{9}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{ }
{10}{I am Jyheirad! Noble warrior from Flame Keep! These are my brave companions, Morrawynd, R'yn-Diak and Frondo! Who might you be?}{I am Jyheirad! Noble warrior from Flame Keep! These are my brave companions, Morrawynd, R'yn-Diak and Frondo! Who might you be?}{}{}{}{ }
{11}{I am known as @pcname@.}{}{5}{}{20}{ }
{12}{I be @pcname@!}{}{-4}{}{0}{fl 190}
{20}{Pray tell, what is your quest? Are you here to recover the famed Blade of Xerxes?}{Pray tell, what is your quest? Are you here to recover the famed Blade of Xerxes?}{}{}{}{ }
{21}{Yes, as a matter of fact, I am.}{}{5}{qa1103 1}{30}{ }
{22}{Uh...why, yes, I am?}{}{5}{qu1103 0}{30}{ }
{23}{Uh, no. Why do you ask?}{}{5}{}{200}{ }
{30}{We too are here for that same purpose! We have been sent by Baron Sug himself to retrieve the Blade! A sizeable fortune awaits our successful return!}{We too are here for that same purpose! We have been sent by Baron Sug himself to retrieve the Blade! A sizeable fortune awaits our successful return!}{}{}{}{ }
{31}{I am here for a much more noble purpose than coin...}{}{5}{ps12, qa1103 1}{40}{ }
{32}{Well, I intend to retrieve it...are you going to try to stop me?}{}{5}{}{0}{fl 170}
{33}{I am here for a much more noble purpose than coin...}{}{5}{ps-11}{0}{fl 191}
{39}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{ }
{40}{[He seems impressed.] Truthfully? And what might that be?}{[He seems impressed.] Truthfully? And what might that be?}{}{}{}{ }
{41}{I need the blade to kill a heinous demon.}{}{5}{}{50}{ }
{42}{Demonic forces will consume the world lest I have the blade!}{}{5}{}{70}{ }
{50}{A lowly demon?! Hah! There a many ways to kill demons, my friend! The fortune we stand to gain is not easily dismissed by a your need for a quick way to dispatch a demon!}{A lowly demon?! Hah! There a many ways to kill demons, my friend! The fortune we stand to gain is not easily dismissed by a your need for a quick way to dispatch a demon!}{}{}{}{ }
{51}{A whole city is being held captive by this evil beast!}{}{5}{}{100}{ }
{52}{The blade is the only sure way to kill this demon.}{}{5}{}{60}{ }
{60}{Methinks you are after a bit of fortune, yourself! Any wizard knows fifty reliable ways for dispatching demons! I wish you luck in your adventure, but I shall give no quarter!}{Methinks you are after a bit of fortune, yourself! Any wizard knows fifty reliable ways for dispatching demons! I wish you luck in your adventure, but I shall give no quarter!}{}{}{}{ }
{61}{Are you insane? This isn't some fantasy world, this is reality!}{}{5}{}{0}{re-5, fl 150}
{69}{Good luck to you, as well.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{70}{By the great god Bhuul! [He smacks his fist into his hand.] What is the nature of this beast?}{By the great god Bhuul! [He smacks his fist into his hand.] What is the nature of this beast?}{}{}{}{ }
{71}{It prowls the night, feeding on the hearts of its victims!}{}{5}{lf4 0}{130}{ }
