{73}{It prowls the night, feeding on the hearts of its victims!}{}{5}{lf4 1}{120}{lf3 1 }
{80}{[He thoughtfully strokes his chin.] And it grows in power after each killing?}{[He thoughtfully strokes his chin.] And it grows in power after each killing?}{}{}{}{ }
