{120}{[He doesn't seem to believe you.] Hah! That sounds like a rather tame demon to me, my friend! "Demonic forces will consume the world"! Indeed! Methinks you are after a bit of fortune, yourself! I wish you luck in your adventure, but I shall give no quarter!}{[He doesn't seem to believe you.] Hah! That sounds like a rather tame demon to me, my friend! "Demonic forces will consume the world"! Indeed! Methinks you are after a bit of fortune, yourself! I wish you luck in your adventure, but I shall give no quarter!}{}{}{}{ }
