{150}{I will pretend I did not hear your remarks, my friend. You are obviously filled with the thrill of the quest! I wish you luck, as I am sure you wish me and my companions!}{I will pretend I did not hear your remarks, my friend. You are obviously filled with the thrill of the quest! I wish you luck, as I am sure you wish me and my companions!}{}{}{}{ }
